<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia has expelled the United Arab Emirates ambassador after accusing Abu Dhabi of violating sovereignty by converting civilian airfields in Somaliland and Puntland into military bases. The federal forces quietly relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy, while Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport and later repelled the attackers. The government is reported to be losing control on two fronts, with intensified fighting in the south and central regions. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSnVXZTRHeHhvcHhsZGVHNENMZWphYWdZZGxfdmE1NUVKRlB6YUdQT0tlZnZqX0hlYWx6cmdyeHl0NmktNXc5Q2d0RlNzTEhhMjZWUmxnX1NTNm1kNjBscEFkaEdCYWM2UFd0cWRtWXZLaTZheWVMTTlUblRGeWlacnM3NWkxeXdEUkRraVZnbWs3M3FzLTdSMnd4UC1yNUtaLWh3allFMVVEb2ZIR0RxYWxSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5vdjZUR2NpZnRyQnBLX0k3RDZfM0NLUEFRcFY3cmxBaDRXVzNMTnBSU2R2b1ZEUnBNREhwd3BaVnFLZm9oTTBBUE5vN2FVNkRETjdMUGxMTkVFcGh6cVNzT2JSeUEtSDNfQWpkOG1sZTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE80LV94STM1SUl4STJUdTFIakJwZkItTGtuR2ExaUJUM3BZUjA5YkhuR21oRFVaM2REVndTMGhIWDVObE5VWnNyVWVITTBtalFDQ3lzXzY0YWxaUDJSVEtnWDlDejBkUHJieDBn?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm